TEMPORARY WORKSPACE

A - Using WORK

:A
USING WORK

I0: (WORK:) is temporary workspace for programs. The game launchers prepare
their data here. WORK is cleared before answering, including startup and call
recovery. There is no general caller copy command or direct upload into WORK.
Completed uploads go to the sysop's private review inbox. Saved RBBS messages
and accounts are kept separately. See HELP GAMES, HELP TRANSFER and HELP
LOGOFF.
